1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:36,159 --> 00:00:37,359
If you ever find someone else,

16
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,039
we're done.

17
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,520
Got it?

18
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,280
I promise.

19
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,039
You're the only one I want.

20
00:00:51,679 --> 00:00:53,000
Like I can trust a man's word.

21
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,840
I promise.

22
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,359
I swear.

23
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,320
Back then,

24
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,200
another man told me

25
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:05,400
he'd love me forever.

26
00:01:06,879 --> 00:01:07,560
Too bad.

27
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,959
I hate promises.

28
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:13,359
Fine.

29
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:14,920
I get it.

30
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,360
(Mr. Liu)

31
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,480
(Mr. Liu)

32
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,879
I need to take this call.

33
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:52,079
Be good. Keep yourself busy for a bit.

34
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:55,959
Hello?

35
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,280
Mr. Liu.

36
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,480
It's me.

37
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:02,760
I'll send you

38
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,920
the case details right now.

39
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,680
(The Criminal Law)

40
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:20,880
This is for you.

41
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,640
I know

42
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,400
you stabbed your stepfather

43
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,840
to protect your mom.

44
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,920
As a legal aid attorney,

45
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,560
I'll take your mom's divorce case

46
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,760
and make sure we win.

47
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,640
Can we really win?

48
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,440
I promise.

49
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,240
Remember,

50
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,240
this isn't where your story ends.

51
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,960
Grow up strong.

52
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,120
I'll email

53
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,879
this file to you later.

54
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,159
(Su Yan.)

55
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,719
(I'm all grown up now.)

56
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:05,800
Don't worry.

57
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,319
I'll give it everything I've got.

58
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,080
When did I ever teach you any of this?

59
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:48,639
I just wanted

60
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,599
to help you relax.

61
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:04,759
(Duan Cizhou)

62
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:05,400
Hey, Su Yan.

63
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,360
Are you home?

64
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,240
Hello?

65
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,519
Su Yan, what are you doing?

66
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:27,079
Hello?

67
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:28,800
Su Yan?

68
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:38,440
=The One=

69
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,000
=Episode 3=

70
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,000
You witch!

71
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:42,560
What the heck are you doing?

72
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,399
Are you a puppy or something?

73
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,600
Are you going to push me away again?

74
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,759
You really don't forget, do you?

75
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,600
I'm just making sure

76
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,319
you don't forget either.

77
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,879
Open up, Su Yan!

78
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:17,839
I know you're in there!

79
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:27,519
Open up and get out here, Su Yan!

80
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:28,519
Open up, Su Yan!

81
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:29,160
Get out here!

82
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,079
Are you crazy?

83
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,399
- He cheated on you.
- (Open up!)

84
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,079
- He broke your heart.
- (Come out, Su Yan!)

85
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,120
Now

86
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:39,879
(Open up!)

87
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:41,800
you can use me to get back at him.

88
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:44,120
- I'm willing to let you use me.
- (Open up!)

89
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:47,240
Don't you like it?

90
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,319
Open up and get out here, Su Yan!

91
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:50,920
Open up!

92
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:22,680
Open up!

93
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:50,240
Tell her to come out.

94
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,680
You're already broken up.

95
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:55,399
So stay away from her.

96
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,279
You're the boy toy
she picked up at the club, right?

97
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,519
What do you have? Money? Status?

98
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,879
And you think you can compete with me?

99
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,000
I'm fit.

100
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,759
I'm young.

101
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,560
And...

102
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:18,839
I

103
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:20,040
am

104
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:20,600
faithful.

105
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:22,560
I've been with her for ten years.

106
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,360
You've known her for what, a few days?

107
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,240
You're just part of our game.

108
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,480
Once she gets bored of you,

109
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,759
she'll dump you.

110
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,480
I'm not wasting my breath on you.

111
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:52,639
Tell her

112
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:55,079
there's a family dinner tomorrow.

113
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,000
(Su Yan.)

114
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:05,200
(Tell me.)

115
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:07,800
(What would make you feel better?)

116
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:11,200
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

117
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:14,720
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

118
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:18,240
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

119
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:22,000
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

120
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:40,480
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

121
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:44,120
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

122
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:47,320
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

123
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:51,000
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

124
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,400
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

125
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:58,080
♪I hum this song alone♪

126
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:01,920
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

127
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:06,000
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

128
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,280
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

129
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:12,880
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

130
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:16,360
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

131
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:21,240
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
